      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2034 characters\">&lt;p&gt;We are pleased to present these newly built 4-bedroom homes located in the prestigious East Legon area. Each home is meticulously designed to offer luxurious living with modern amenities and thoughtful details:&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2034 characters\">&lt;p&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Expansive Living Areas&lt;/strong&gt;:The ground floor features a spacious hall, ideal for hosting and family activities.&lt;br&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Luxurious Master Suite&lt;/strong&gt;:The exceptionally large master bedroom offers unparalleled comfort and space.&lt;br&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Fully Outfitted Bedrooms&lt;/strong&gt;: All bedrooms are equipped with built-in wardrobes.&lt;br&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Guest Washroom&lt;/strong&gt;: A conveniently located guest washroom is available for visitors.&lt;br&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Comprehensive Climate Control&lt;/strong&gt;:Air conditioning units are installed throughout the home for optimal comfort.&lt;br&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;State-of-the-Art Kitchen&lt;/strong&gt;: The kitchen is fully equipped with high-end appliances, including a microwave, oven, stove, and extractor.&lt;br&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Reliable Water Supply&lt;/strong&gt;: A water reservoir ensures a constant and reliable water supply.&lt;br&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Designated Dining Area&lt;/strong&gt;: A separate dining area is provided for family meals and entertaining.&lt;br&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Enhanced Security&lt;/strong&gt;: The property is secured with an electric fence and an automated gate.&lt;br&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Prime Accessibility&lt;/strong&gt;: The location offers easy access to major roads, ensuring convenient travel.&lt;br&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Additional Living Quarters&lt;/strong&gt;:The property includes boys&#039; quarters for additional accommodation needs.&lt;br&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Leisure Facilities:&lt;/strong&gt;Enjoy a private swimming pool for relaxation and recreation.&lt;br&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Ample Parking Space:&lt;/strong&gt;There is generous parking space available for multiple vehicles.&lt;br&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Bedroom Configuration&lt;/strong&gt;: The home features a well-thought-out layout with one bedroom on the ground floor and three bedrooms on the first floor.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2034 characters\">&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;-&lt;strong&gt;Boys Quarters&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;</span>
      \"\"\"
